# L9 (B-058): keep secrets & heavy dirs out of the Docker build context.
# docker/compose.yaml uses `context: ..`, CI/Publish use `context: .` —
# without this file the whole repo (.env, data/, secrets/, .git, .venv)
# is tarred and sent to the Docker daemon on every build.
.git
.venv
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
data/
secrets/
*.session
**/__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
dist/
build/
docs/
nginx/
scripts/
tests/
.github/
# *.md intentionally NOT excluded: Dockerfile COPYs pyproject.toml + README.md
